      "study": "These factors follow the energy per image of the study “The Hidden Cost of an Image: Quantifying the Energy Consumption of AI Image Generation”: about 1.5 Wh for a 1024 × 1024 image, and 5 Wh for a 2048 × 2048 image by extrapolation.",
